     A* 03/19/01  C:132 PROJECT CI015
     A*                 Add field for "Number of years to extract"
     A*                 to be passed into programs for incremental
     A*                 extract, this will be in the format of CYY
     A*                 like policy year field in PDS files. The
     A*                 incremental programs will only process years
     A*                 after this policy year.
